  unitId: 860637
  unitNumber: 8471
  description: Acnologia, the Black Dragon of the Apocalypse, is so destructive that
    the mere mention of his name is terror itself. In times long past, it was said
    that he was capable of singlehandedly annihilating a nation, and that he could
    wipe islands off the map with but a roar. The Black Wizard, Zeref, has dubbed
    him "the most dangerous dragon."
  summonDesc: I am king of the dragons!!! Acnologia!!!
  fusionDesc: Is THIS all the power you can muster?!
